    "title": "Are post offices, banks open today for Easter Monday?",
    "text": "AdvertisementReturn to HomepageTop Stories: Israel and Lebanon ceasefirePlay Crushable by Candy CrushJustin Fairfax murder-suicideTrump's push to oust PowellU.S.-Iran ceasefireTrump's new AI Jesus imageNew Eric Swalwell allegationsThe 'Luddite boyfriend' trendWNBA draft outfitsHeartland severe weather alertsBrian Hooker's messagesAre post offices, banks open today for Easter Monday?Heading to the post office or the bank on Easter Monday? Good news — they're open.United States Postal Service locations are open during normal hours throughout Bucks County on April 6. But be sure to check times at your local post office before you go — some smaller sites close for lunch.Most banks in our area are also open today, from national banks to credit unions.And if you're itching to make trades after your errands today, the stock market is open, too.This article originally appeared on Bucks County Courier Times: Is post office, bank open today in Bucks County?View commentsTerms and Privacy PolicyPrivacy DashboardAbout Our AdsTerms and Privacy PolicyPrivacy DashboardAbout Our AdsRecommended articlesAdvertisementAdvertisementAdvertisement",
